{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202500","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202500","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120250001:1":{"text":"待って！クージン、どこまで送る気！？もうブラックロアーからだいぶ離れたよ……","source_cn":"等等！库金，你送得太远了！这里距离黑嚎的领地……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD80F8B1950B410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120250002:2":{"text":"実は……俺はもうブラックロアーに戻らないつもりなんだ。","source_cn":"其实……我已经不打算回黑嚎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80BAEB920CA3491B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120250003:1":{"text":"クルーガーとは話をつけてある。今日をもって、俺はブラックロアーを離脱する。","source_cn":"我和克鲁格说过了，从今天开始，我会离开黑嚎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB84CC897B16CCC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120250004:1":{"text":"これからは、自分の力だけで新しい氏族を築くんだ。そしてその氏族を、頂点へと導いてやる。","source_cn":"接下来，我会依靠自己的力量，建立全新的氏族，然后带领我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE27D566FCC0B7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120250005:1":{"text":"お前たちがかつてそうしたようにな。","source_cn":"就像你们过去曾经做到的那样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A8FDF9F0BC5577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",